{"unit_id": "cv-superding__dsh-webin#card-zh", "repo": "cv-superding/dsh-webin", "commit": "dfa52627e9bec84f269e9fa78e8e342a98dea0e3", "type": "card", "lang": "zh", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["src/host/index.ts:574-693", "src/host/adapter.ts:1181-1280", "src/client/index.ts:5160-5237", "src/shared/providers.ts:98-216"], "text": "**dsh-webin**（DSH 插件，Desktop/Web 客户端）：通过真实浏览器为 DSH 提供 DeepSeek 与通义千问网页模型。它把模型请求从 host 派给浏览器 client，再将网页回复交回 DSH。功能包括 DeepSeek 快速与思考模式、Qwen、自定义网页 provider，以及登录入口和参数设置。适合希望在 DSH 对话中使用网页模型的用户。需要对应网页账号及支持 browser guest 桥的 Desktop/Electron 宿主。"}
{"unit_id": "cv-superding__dsh-webin#card-en", "repo": "cv-superding/dsh-webin", "commit": "dfa52627e9bec84f269e9fa78e8e342a98dea0e3", "type": "card", "lang": "en", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["src/host/index.ts:574-693", "src/host/adapter.ts:1181-1280", "src/client/index.ts:5160-5237", "src/shared/providers.ts:98-216"], "text": "**dsh-webin** brings DeepSeek and Qwen web models into DSH through a real browser. It returns browser replies to DSH and offers DeepSeek fast and thinking modes, custom providers, login access, and settings. Requires a web account and a Desktop/Electron host with the browser guest bridge."}
