{"unit_id": "cv-superding__dsh-webin#feature-2", "repo": "cv-superding/dsh-webin", "commit": "dfa52627e9bec84f269e9fa78e8e342a98dea0e3", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["src/host/index.ts:1510-1579", "src/client/index.ts:4140-4170"], "text": "**dsh-webin** 的功能「自定义网页 provider」：设置页可提交 Provider JSON、查看平台清单并移除自定义项。Host 校验并保存 provider 文件，供模型选择和浏览器面板使用。"}
{"unit_id": "cv-superding__dsh-webin#feature-4", "repo": "cv-superding/dsh-webin", "commit": "dfa52627e9bec84f269e9fa78e8e342a98dea0e3", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["src/client/index.ts:5160-5237", "src/host/index.ts:139-183"], "text": "**dsh-webin** 的功能「网页模型面板与登录入口」：在 DSH shell overlay 保持浏览器宿主，并在 conversation view 添加 LDW 占位视图；输入框旁的 LDW 入口可打开登录流程。"}
